  m_Name: Dlg_Teach_OS_13_Reboot
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogSequence
  lines:
  - speakerName: Guide
    text: Pull the flash drive out at this first restart, or the PC boots the installer
      all over again instead of the Windows you just installed. If you left the boot
      order pointing at USB, this is where it bites.
